    turnFlow: 'Each round is 9 tricks. Players must play in the lead suit if possible; otherwise any card may be played. The highest trump in the trick wins, or if no trump was played, the highest card of the led suit wins. The trick winner leads the next trick. La Morte is played as if in the trump suit: players may never lead La Morte unless it is their only card. La Morte wins any trick when trump was led; if led off-trump it loses and the taker becomes Il Morto (scores for that trick but plays no more tricks; lead passes left).',
